		{
			"text": "In May, designs were basic. Now, it uses rich animations and graphics. 3D was a simple shape. Now, it renders real-time scenes on the GPU. Product UI was a dashboard that played itself. Now, someone's using it. A cursor, a panning camera, a real route change. In May, narration sync was by line. Now, it's timed to every word. Both videos were made with VideoWrite, an open-source framework that gives Claude everything it needs to make videos: animation, styles, voiceovers, sound effects, music, and more. Download it free on GitHub.",
